ends. Feel the pulse of a city that breathes history in every stone. <\/span><\/p><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">What will you discover on this tour?<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">The imposing <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Pla\u00e7a des Born<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">, the city&#8217;s nerve center and witness to its history.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\" style=\"background-color: transparent;\">The exteriors of the <\/span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Town Hall<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\" style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, the elegant <\/span><strong style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Teatre des Born<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\" style=\"background-color: transparent;\">, and the palaces that surround it.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">The charm of the <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">natural harbor of Ciutadella<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">, with its traditional boats and seafaring atmosphere.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">The majestic naves of the <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Cathedral-Basilica of Santa Mar\u00eda de Menorca<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">, a jewel of Catalan Gothic architecture.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">The secrets of the <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Monastery of Santa Clara<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> and the stories held within its walls.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Anecdotes and local curiosities that only an island guide can tell you.<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Languages:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> Spanish, English, and French. <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Duration:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> 2 hours.<\/span><\/p><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Includes:<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Walking tour with an accredited official guide.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Detailed historical and cultural explanations.<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Does not include:<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Tickets to monuments that require a ticket (optional).<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Transportation to the meeting point.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Tips.<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Cancellation Policy<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">By booking, you accept the following conditions:<\/span><\/p><ul><li><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Free cancellation:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> You can cancel free of charge up to <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">24 hours<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">  before the start time of the tour. You will be reimbursed 100% of the amount. <\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Late cancellations or no-shows:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> If you cancel less than 24 hours in advance or do not show up at the meeting point at the agreed time, no refund will be made.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Cancellation by the guide:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">  The tour may be canceled due to force majeure (e.g., weather alert). Additionally, being a group tour,   <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">a minimum number of participants is required for it to take place.<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">. If this minimum is not 